  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "視覺藝術研究方法論",
    "sub_ename": "RESEARCH METHODOLOGY OF VISUAL ARTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在引介視覺藝術的基礎觀念、重要研究方法與理論，使學生認識相關領域切入問題的角度與方式，並引導學生思索如何將理論進一步實踐在研究上，以充實藝術寫作的理論基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the fundamental concepts, important research methods and theories in the visual arts. Students can learn the perspectives and approaches to problems in the field. The aim of the course is to initiate students to think about how to apply the theories in their investigations for the purpose of enriching the theoretical basis of artistic writings.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
